# ---------- personal data ----------
# Your real resume carries your phone number, email, and full work history.
# It lives on disk and never enters git; `profiles/example.json` is the only
# committed profile and it is a fictional student.
profiles/*.json
!profiles/example.json
resume.typ
resume.pdf
resume.txt
# Reference resumes used for local testing — real PDFs with real contact details.
resume/
out/
*_tailored.typ
*_tailored.pdf
jd.txt
jd/


